$start_stage
$multi_text
 XSTR("The Regulus node is located within a small asteroid field. Our job is to clear a path. Asteroids on a collision course with the Iceni will be indicated in white brackets on your HUD. That's how you know which asteroids to shoot. The gunners on the Iceni will help us out, so we shouldn't have too much trouble.", 53)
$end_multi_text
$voice: LP1-1_MB_03.wav
